  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Rinse and drain white rice.\n• In a medium saucepan, add the water (for the rice) and bring to the boil.\n• Add white rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove pan from heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340170a756d38d6af30743/step-888ae800.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While rice is cooking, thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Trim green beans and cut into thirds.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340170a756d38d6af30743/step-a7714d10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook green beans and carrot, tossing, until tender, 4-6 minutes. Transfer to a bowl and set aside.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Add ginger paste, garlic paste, tandoori paste and mild North Indian spice blend to the pan. Cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add light cooking cream, the water (for the sauce), brown sugar, cooked veggies and the salt, simmer until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340170a756d38d6af30743/step-5395f420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice between bowls.\n• Top with Indian-style haloumi and pumpkin curry.\n• Tear over coriander to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340170a756d38d6af30743/step-d72d3530.jpg"
    }
  ]
